{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408074-50-character-builder-questions-for-your-exalted-character","id":1408074,"title":"50 Character Builder Questions for your Exalted Character","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-13T17:07:49-07:00","id":1408074,"title":"50 Character Builder Questions for your Exalted Character","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTvrd1K4s8nwkxbT6eNQmje4_tDVoufweRmxMRecCT9F5PhNjyFOy43ydu-DJ--UGp8Z2Y6oMlvh0TB/pub\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTvrd1K4s8nwkxbT6eNQmje4_tDVoufweRmxMRecCT9F5PhNjyFOy43ydu-DJ--UGp8Z2Y6oMlvh0TB/pub\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTvrd1K4s8nwkxbT6eNQmje4_tDVoufweRmxMRecCT9F5PhNjyFOy43ydu-DJ--UGp8Z2Y6oMlvh0TB/pub\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTvrd1K4s8nwkxbT6eNQmje4_tDVoufweRmxMRecCT9F5PhNjyFOy43ydu-DJ--UGp8Z2Y6oMlvh0TB/pub </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-14T00:34:49-07:00","id":1408113,"title":"","content":"Looks fun. For Cynis Ganan:<br /> <br /> 1. Are you a morning person or more of a night owl?<br /> <br /> &quot;Duty knows not a time of day! A scion of the Realm stands ready at all times!&quot;<br /> <br /> Ganan is not a morning person. He rises early to perform his daily ablutions, but is taciturn and sluggish doing it. He's also not a night owl: he likes his sleep. He's more of a &quot;noon&quot; person.<br /> <br /> 2. What\u2019s the first thing you notice about a person when you meet them?<br /> <br /> &quot;Warriors carry weapons. As do assassins. A person's choice of blade or bow tells one all one needs to know.&quot;<br /> <br /> 3. You see a huge spider in your room. What do you do?<br /> <br /> &quot;Usually, in my room, I'm studying?&quot;<br /> <br /> Ganan is unbothered by spiders.<br /> <br /> 4. If you could go back and change one decision you made in the past, what would you change?<br /> <br /> &quot;This conversation is over.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ganan is haunted by his first love, Amilar Shavok, who betrayed him, murdered their Sworn Kinship and left Ganan with his legs broken in a Manse that was about to explode.<br /> <br /> 5. Tell me about your first kiss.<br /> <br /> &quot;Is that a euphemism?&quot;<br /> <br /> Ganan was raised by one of the most successful madames on the Blessed Isle and schooled in the arts from a young age. His first kiss was an instructive lesson with a slave, not a romantic endeavour.<br /> <br /> 6. Do you give people second chances?<br /> <br /> &quot;No.&quot;<br /> <br /> 7. Are you a cat person or a dog person?<br /> <br /> &quot;Cat is too stringy, but the odour of roasted dog is unpalatable. Mouse, horse, chicken -- all preferable.&quot;<br /> <br /> 8. Do you think you\u2019re attractive?<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes.&quot;<br /> <br /> 9. What\u2019s your worst habit?<br /> <br /> &quot;There are... <i>expectations</i> of Dynasts: I don't meet them. I am too coarse. Unrefined, like a Lost Egg. But Creation is so vast, its secrets so deep... There isn't time for niceties and games!&quot;<br /> <br /> 10. When was the last time you cried?<br /> <br /> &quot;The mountain does not weep.&quot;<br /> <br /> Crossing Cecelyn after the death of his companion Whims-of-the-Flesh.<br /> <br /> 11. Are you a good liar?<br /> <br /> &quot;No.&quot;<br /> <br /> 12. What\u2019s your biggest pet peeve?<br /> <br /> &quot;The mountain is not moved by triviality.&quot;<br /> <br /> His sister, Cynis Falen Jinabar, irritates him in every way imaginable. They're currently on a month long journey together, camping in the wilderness.<br /> <br /> 13. Have you ever had your heart broken?<br /> <br /> &quot;... Yes.&quot;<br /> <br /> His boyfriends Amilar Shavok and Whims-of-the-Flesh. Also his wife is conducting an affair with a mortal princess. Ganan isn't in touch with his feelings enough to articulate why this bothers him (his wife has taken many lovers, often with his enthusiastic encouragement and even by his recommendation), but it's because she seems to genuinely love this woman and he is jealous. Growing up in a Cynis brothel has kinda stunted Ganan's emotional feeling.<br /> <br /> 14. Are you more likely to use your fists or your words in an argument?<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't argue.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's true. Cynis Ganan is loyal to his wife's house. The women make the decisions and do the talking, then Ganan follows through. Which usually means beating the problem to death with his fists.<br /> <br /> 15. What\u2019s something you\u2019re naturally good at?<br /> <br /> &quot;The lore of Creation past yields naturally to me. As do the hidden secrets of the now. I inducted myself into sorcery as a boy.&quot;<br /> <br /> 16. What\u2019s something you had to work hard to be good at?<br /> <br /> &quot;As a child, martial arts came easy to me. Perhaps I would have done well in the Cloister of Wisdom. Mastering Earth Dragon Style without an Immaculate tutor was the hardest thing I've ever done. But it's worth it.&quot;<br /> <br /> 17. Can you tell when someone is flirting with you?<br /> <br /> &quot;... of course.&quot;<br /> <br /> He can't. Not even a little bit.<br /> <br /> 18. Do you think money can buy happiness?<br /> <br /> &quot;Jade is a means. Only filling one's duty in the Perfected Heirachy can bring happiness.&quot;<br /> <br /> 19. Do you believe in destiny?<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course. But every human, great and small, has the power to pervert destiny.&quot;<br /> <br /> 20. Are you a good cook?<br /> <br /> &quot;No.&quot;<br /> <br /> Actually he is. But he judges himself by the Cynis slaves who created the lavish meals of his childhood.<br /> <br /> 21. What do you think happens after you die?<br /> <br /> &quot;We are reincarnated. The goal of life is to fulfil the duties of one's station to move closer to the Elemental Dragons. Ghosts are a perversion of the natural order.&quot;<br /> <br /> 22. Did you have to grow up fast?<br /> <br /> &quot;I was indulged the same wet nurse until my second birthday. And I was beaten only rarely for failing my lessons from then until attending the Heptagram. In retrospect, such a soft and pampered childhood may have weakened me somewhat. Certainly my own children have received harsher discipline.&quot;<br /> <br /> He's a Dynast raised in a brothel. He might not have grown up on the streets but he didn't have a childhood.<br /> <br /> 23. Who do you look up to?<br /> <br /> &quot;My wife, Mnemon Alinos Danireya, is the model Dynast. Ragara Bhaghwei, my old master, is the perfect scholar. Pasiap, of course, is the model Dragon-Blooded.&quot;<br /> <br /> 24. When you go to a tavern, what do you order?<br /> <br /> &quot;Food, drink, perhaps lodging?&quot;<br /> <br /> 25. What do you like most about yourself?<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't understand the question.&quot;<br /> <br /> His mind.<br /> <br /> 26. What do you like least about yourself?<br /> <br /> &quot;You know I am Exalted, correct?&quot;<br /> <br /> He feels clumsy. Being crippled by an exploding Manse has taken decades of physical therapy including rare, mystic, treatments, to get Ganan to the point where he can walk without a cane. Even though he's fully recovered, he still feels broken. Part of that is mental trauma, part is emotional anguish.<br /> <br /> 27. Do you want kids someday?<br /> <br /> &quot;I have two fine children *pause, guilty smile* and another on the way.&quot;<br /> <br /> 28. Are you a planner, or more spontaneous?<br /> <br /> &quot;The mountain is.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ganan believes in plans. He thinks they should be made and stuck to. Ganan... doesn't stick to plans. He'll follow orders, but he'll do what he thinks is right in the heat of the moment, then berate others for not following the plan.<br /> <br /> 29. Can you keep a secret?<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course.&quot;<br /> <br /> He can't.<br /> <br /> 30. Do you like being the center of attention?<br /> <br /> &quot;That is a burdeon that must sometimes be endured.&quot;<br /> <br /> He doesn't.<br /> <br /> 31. If you knew you were going to die tomorrow, what would you do today?<br /> <br /> &quot;My duty.&quot;<br /> <br /> 32. Do you enjoy getting all dressed up for a special occasion?<br /> <br /> &quot;I enjoy not being invited to such vacuous wastes of time!&quot;<br /> <br /> No. But he dresses in finery to brawl people in the street, so...<br /> <br /> 33. Where do you feel safe?<br /> <br /> &quot;In Creation.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mostly this is a pompous way of saying he feels safe everywhere. But he was recently in the Boardermarches and Malfeas and he did not feel safe in either place.<br /> <br /> 34. Do you love or hate being alone?<br /> <br /> &quot;They say Humans and Dragons are social animals, but I prefer my own company.&quot;<br /> <br /> 35. What\u2019s the last nightmare you remember having?<br /> <br /> &quot;The mountain does not dream.&quot;<br /> <br /> Every night he dreams of Shavok betraying him. Every night for forty two years.<br /> <br /> 36. Do you admit to mistakes when you make them?<br /> <br /> &quot;It is more efficient to simply not make mistakes.&quot;<br /> <br /> He does not admit his mistakes.<br /> <br /> 37. Do you want to grow up to be like your parents?<br /> <br /> &quot;All Dragons have their place: mine is not within House Cynis Falen.&quot;<br /> <br /> 38. How do you deal with being sick? Are you stoic, or super whiny?<br /> <br /> &quot;The mountain is not 'super whiny'!&quot;<br /> <br /> SUUUUUUPER whiny.<br /> <br /> 39. What did your parents expect from you when you were born?<br /> <br /> &quot;My father expected me to become Immaculate. My mother wanted a successor. Fortunately the birth of my sister eleviated the latter expectation.<br /> <br /> 40. Do you have a strong sense of style?<br /> <br /> &quot;Adornments are baubles.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ganan dresses in the height of fashion... for forty years ago when he still had Cynis slaves to dress him. He doesn't seem to realise that no-one else in the Dynasty wears house colours and capes anymore.<br /> <br /> 41. Would you rather camp outdoors or stay the night in an inn?<br /> <br /> &quot;The mountain endures all discomforts.&quot;<br /> <br /> 42. Is there a food that most people like that you absolutely hate?<br /> <br /> &quot;I just said I don't like cat or dog.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ganan doesn't like tea. Which, in the Dynasty, is kinda a big thing.<br /> <br /> 43. Are you more of a hoarder or a minimalist?<br /> <br /> He's a hoarder.<br /> <br /> 44. Are you superstitious?<br /> <br /> He's a sorcerer. The superstitions he believes in are mostly true.<br /> <br /> 45. Are you the kind of person who remembers people\u2019s birthdays and pets\u2019 names and stuff?<br /> <br /> Hahaha! No!<br /> <br /> 46. What do you do to feel better when you\u2019re sad?<br /> <br /> &quot;Mediation cleanses the mind. Exercise cleanses the body.&quot;<br /> <br /> Ever watch/read Fight Club? Fight Club.<br /> <br /> 47. Is it hard for you to trust someone?<br /> <br /> &quot;Fools trust. The mountain endures.&quot;<br /> <br /> 48. Are you susceptible to peer pressure?<br /> <br /> &quot;No.&quot;<br /> <br /> 49. If you decided to stop adventuring and settle down, what kind of job would you take?<br /> <br /> &quot;At my core, I am a teacher. Though travel teaches me much, I long to return to the Isle of Voices. Perhaps in retirement.&quot;<br /> <br /> 50. As a kid, what did you want to be when you grew up?<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't laugh... I wanted... ... it doesn't matter now.&quot;<br /> <br /> To marry the Scarlet Empress and become Emperor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 08-14-2020, 07:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-15T20:25:57-07:00","id":1408450,"title":"","content":"Answers for Poena Hanim <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/d6c14e10-7eed-4b13-a17e-ab23508e9a5d/d631x1m-0cf3cffd-de13-4282-87d5-b06693c740bc.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..taFnZEgQzhz6MgIToCpP7ZTpPcs5pKexwEErLqw_YGI\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a morning person or more of a night owl? </div> </div> </div> I\u2019m more of an evening person to be sure.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the first thing you notice about a person when you meet them? </div> </div> </div> Probably their attire, clothes make the man or woman and I like to offer critique. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You see a huge spider in your room. What do you do? </div> </div> </div> Find somewhere else to live.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you could go back and change one decision you made in the past, what would you change? </div> </div> </div> If I could do it without changing the person I am now? I would\u2019ve found a better way to end my first marriage. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tell me about your first kiss. </div> </div> </div> It was okay. The first time I kissed my now wife Driana I knew why. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you give people second chances? </div> </div> </div> Hurt me? Yes. Hurt someone I love, and I will make you suffer. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a cat person or a dog person? </div> </div> </div> I adore cats. It is a little-known fact that in Chiaroscuro a great number of them roam the streets at night and control the vermin population. My grandmother respected this symbiosis and would have me leave treats to our nocturnal protectors. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think you\u2019re attractive? </div> </div> </div> Darling, I know I\u2019m attractive!<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your worst habit? </div> </div> </div> I have extremely poor impulse control at times. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When was the last time you cried? </div> </div> </div> I cried with relief when I discovered that someone who I care deeply for was alive.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good liar? </div> </div> </div> When the situation calls for it.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your biggest pet peeve? </div> </div> </div> People who don\u2019t respect soft power. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Have you ever had your heart broken? </div> </div> </div> Yes.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more likely to use your fists or your words in an argument? </div> </div> </div> Words are the recourse of the civilised, but I\u2019m mindful of the fact they can cut deeper than a knife. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you\u2019re naturally good at? </div> </div> </div> I\u2019ve got a good head for numbers and see profitable ventures in areas others might overlook.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you had to work hard to be good at? </div> </div> </div> Empathy. I try to be a better person but it\u2019s so easy to lapse into constantly looking over my shoulder for potential threats. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you tell when someone is flirting with you? </div> </div> </div> If she\u2019s pretty I\u2019m normally flirting right back.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think money can buy happiness? </div> </div> </div> To an extent, yes. People who argue that there\u2019s no correlation between money and happiness have access to everything they need. I do believe that pursuit of money can become a cage though.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you believe in destiny? </div> </div> </div> I do.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good cook? </div> </div> </div> I am an exquisite cook.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you think happens after you die? </div> </div> </div> I suppose you stop living, does continuation of the soul really matter without the experiences that shaped us?<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Did you have to grow up fast? </div> </div> </div> Not compared to some, but I look back on my first marriage and I still felt like a child.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Who do you look up to? </div> </div> </div> I always looked up to my grandmother and lost an important part of myself when she passed. I respect a lot of people but attempts to replace her with a new mentor have met with failure\u2026 my mother-in-law doesn\u2019t much care for me. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When you go to a tavern, what do you order? </div> </div> </div> It really depends on where I am and if I trust them to get anything more complicated than water right. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like most about yourself? </div> </div> </div> My wits. While I\u2019m not always the smartest person in the room I will often approach problems in a way that others wouldn\u2019t consider. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like least about yourself? </div> </div> </div> My sometimes-poor impulse control, particularly when it leads me to lash out. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want kids someday? </div> </div> </div> Absolutely not.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a planner, or more spontaneous? </div> </div> </div> I wish I could be more spontaneous, but if I\u2019m in charge of something I have a need for control. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you keep a secret? </div> </div> </div> Of course. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you like being the center of attention? </div> </div> </div> Far too much for my own good.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you knew you were going to die tomorrow, what would you do today? </div> </div> </div> Make the most of the time with my wife. I am certain you can use your imagination without me painting a picture.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you enjoy getting all dressed up for a special occasion? </div> </div> </div> Why a special occasion? Can one not simply claim a moment to celebrate themselves and their success. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where do you feel safe? </div> </div> </div> Home. Wherever that might be of course. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you love or hate being alone? </div> </div> </div> I don\u2019t like to be alone.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the last nightmare you remember having? </div> </div> </div> I dream of becoming the sort of person who\u2019d hurt the people I care most about. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you admit to mistakes when you make them? </div> </div> </div> Yes, within reason. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want to grow up to be like your parents? </div> </div> </div> I\u2019ve already surpassed their merge life goals. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How do you deal with being sick? Are you stoic, or super whiny? </div> </div> </div> I make quite a drama of it so my wife will take care of me.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What did your parents expect from you when you were born? </div> </div> </div> A dowry from a rich husband, I suspect. I don\u2019t owe them anything else. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you have a strong sense of style? </div> </div> </div> I am often emulated and usually flattered by the effort. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Would you rather camp outdoors or stay the night in an inn? </div> </div> </div> Almost always the inn. Even if I might not trust what they consider a beverage.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there a food that most people like that you absolutely hate? </div> </div> </div> I am not a lover of onions. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more of a hoarder or a minimalist? </div> </div> </div> I want to be a minimalist, but my wife and I occasionally get sentimental over items. I fear that this is how many hoarders begin. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you superstitious? </div> </div> </div> I\u2019m aware of and respectful of tradition and folklore because of my grandmother but I don\u2019t let it limit my actions. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you the kind of person who remembers people\u2019s birthdays and pets\u2019 names and stuff? </div> </div> </div> Yes, I\u2019m also the kind of person to drop hints to someone that they\u2019ve forgotten something.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you do to feel better when you\u2019re sad? </div> </div> </div> Find someone to hold me. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is it hard for you to trust someone? </div> </div> </div> Yes.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you susceptible to peer pressure? </div> </div> </div> Sometimes.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you decided to stop adventuring and settle down, what kind of job would you take? </div> </div> </div> I always like to mentor people of promise, likely something in that capacity. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As a kid, what did you want to be when you grew up? </div> </div> </div> As a child my horizons were limited by my society\u2019s view of womanhood. I wanted to be happy and successful but was content to enjoy that by proxy through a husband and sons. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T05:53:22-07:00","id":1408477,"title":"","content":"And since Lioness is doing the responses for her PC in my game, I'll do mine for Joyous Sky, my zenith from her game. Or it's just a shameless excuse to be indulgent for my favourite PC<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tskJh8L.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a morning person or more of a night owl? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI only sleep for a few hours most nights. I suppose that makes me a night owl by a lot of peoples standards\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the first thing you notice about a person when you meet them? </div> </div> </div>\u201cTheir confidence and how they carry themselves\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You see a huge spider in your room. What do you do? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWonder if it\u2019s my mate Juniper playing games with me. Then get annoyed at her for being in my head even if it\u2019s just a spider.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you could go back and change one decision you made in the past, what would you change? </div> </div> </div>\u201cBe less judgemental about certain people on first meeting them\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tell me about your first kiss. </div> </div> </div>\u201cIt was awkward and blindsided me. invited a water aspect to stay with me as her accommodations weren\u2019t suitable. I was naive...She had other ideas. Not much has changed. We\u2019re married now but she still tends to sweep me along and drag me out of my shell\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you give people second chances? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI used to be much more uncompromising. But my experiences with some abyssal exalted have softened me. It\u2019s something I\u2019m trying hard to be better at.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a cat person or a dog person? </div> </div> </div>\u201cDefinitely cat. I\u2019d say that anyway but my mate is a Sand Cat totem so I don\u2019t really have a choice.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think you\u2019re attractive? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI know other people think I am. I still have a hard time seeing myself like that and compare myself to others too much.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your worst habit? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI\u2019m not good at leaving things and relaxing. I have a very hard time shutting off\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When was the last time you cried? </div> </div> </div>\u201cProbably the last time I got really frustrated with something\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good liar? </div> </div> </div>\u201cNo. Even thinking about it makes me anxious. I have a hard enough time getting the right words out as it is.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your biggest pet peeve? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWhen Juniper decides to find odd places to sleep. She leaves hair in hard to clean places and has a perfectly good bed!\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Have you ever had your heart broken? </div> </div> </div>\u201cNot personally. But part of me remembers how my predecessor felt when she lost someone she loved. It turned her into someone I don\u2019t want to be...but it scares me that I don\u2019t know how I would react to something like that\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more likely to use your fists or your words in an argument? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWords. Or rather music. I\u2019d rather try and sway someone but I\u2019m much better at conveying things with music\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you\u2019re naturally good at? </div> </div> </div>\u201cMusic. It\u2019s always come easy and things always seem so much more simple to articulate with it.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you had to work hard to be good at? </div> </div> </div>\u201cDealing with people. It\u2019s still a big work in progress but I\u2019m not quite as neurotic as I used to be.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you tell when someone is flirting with you? </div> </div> </div>\u201cSometimes. Normally it\u2019s easier for me if I\u2019m oblivious.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think money can buy happiness? </div> </div> </div>\u201cNo. But I think not having it can be a barrier to people being happy.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you believe in destiny? </div> </div> </div>\u201cA little. But I believe I\u2019ve been given the power to push back against it. For better or worse\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good cook? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI\u2019m not going to poison anyone but my wives are much better than I am\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you think happens after you die? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWe pass into Lethe and the cycle moves on. I believe strongly in being able to help people make that transition as easily as possible. I\u2019ve seen too much pain from lingering too long.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Did you have to grow up fast? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI was raised in a frozen shadowland waylaid by the dead. Yes\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Who do you look up to? </div> </div> </div>\u201cThe Unconquered Sun is someone I view like a father I\u2019m determined to make proud of me. After that my wife Linarra and how composed and assured and elegant she manages to be effortlessly. Growing up it was my Grandfather. He was the largest presence in my life and I miss him.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When you go to a tavern, what do you order? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI don\u2019t normally drink much but I prefer wine when I do.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like most about yourself? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI hate this question. Probably my principals. I would like to think I\u2019m a good person\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like least about yourself? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI can find it really hard to switch off and I spend my life fixating over even little things. I\u2019m inflexible and I hate how hard it can make me to be around.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want kids someday? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWe have twins. I adore them but worry about the sort of parent I\u2019m capable of being\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a planner, or more spontaneous? </div> </div> </div>\u201cIf I\u2019m not able to plan things out it makes me anxious. I say that it\u2019s a product of growing up in a shadowland where things being overlooked could be deadly...but I think it\u2019s just how my head works.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you keep a secret? </div> </div> </div>\u201cYes\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you like being the center of attention? </div> </div> </div>\u201cIt depends on the sort of attention. There\u2019s some situations I\u2019m much more comfortable with than others.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you knew you were going to die tomorrow, what would you do today? </div> </div> </div>\u201cTry and enjoy it with the people I love and try not to worry about what I\u2019m leaving undone\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you enjoy getting all dressed up for a special occasion? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI do. Even if it can make me self conscious\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where do you feel safe? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWith my wife Linarra\u2019s arms around me\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you love or hate being alone? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI often find being alone easier but I hate how lonely it can feel.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the last nightmare you remember having? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI get flashes of my predecessor sometimes. I try not to fixate on them. The guilt and pain would cripple me if I did\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you admit to mistakes when you make them? </div> </div> </div>\u201cIt\u2019s something I could be better at.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want to grow up to be like your parents? </div> </div> </div>\u201cMy parents died when I was young. I was desperate to be like my grandfather\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How do you deal with being sick? Are you stoic, or super whiny? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI try and keep going...and become intolerable when I get frustrated that I can\u2019t\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What did your parents expect from you when you were born? </div> </div> </div>\u201cMy father named me Joyous Sky...I would like to think that shows how much hope he had for me\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you have a strong sense of style? </div> </div> </div>\u201cNo. I prefer comfortable and functional.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Would you rather camp outdoors or stay the night in an inn? </div> </div> </div>\u201cStay at an inn.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there a food that most people like that you absolutely hate? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI can\u2019t deal with anything spicy. Embarrassingly so\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more of a hoarder or a minimalist? </div> </div> </div>\u201cMinimalist. But the objects that are important to me I treasure\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you superstitious? </div> </div> </div>\u201cA little. It\u2019s hard to grow up like I did and not be\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you the kind of person who remembers people\u2019s birthdays and pets\u2019 names and stuff? </div> </div> </div>\u201cYes. Definitely\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you do to feel better when you\u2019re sad? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI play my flute. Sometimes when even that\u2019s too much I\u2019ll just sit with it and run my fingers over the holes while I play music in my head.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is it hard for you to trust someone? </div> </div> </div>\u201cSometimes. But once I do I trust them implicitly\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you susceptible to peer pressure? </div> </div> </div>\u201cNo. I\u2019m far too stubborn\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you decided to stop adventuring and settle down, what kind of job would you take? </div> </div> </div>\u201cA musician\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As a kid, what did you want to be when you grew up? </div> </div> </div>\u201cA ghost hunter my community would be proud of and able to depend on\u201d<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13512,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13512-andrix","user":"andrix","date":". 08-16-2020, 08:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13512-andrix","name":"andrix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T07:37:28-07:00","id":1408495,"title":"","content":"Here\u2019s mine for <b>The Knight Raiton</b>, Eclipse Caste Solar and son of Nexus.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a morning person or more of a night owl? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI am a creature of the night by necessity.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the first thing you notice about a person when you meet them? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWhether they want to hide something from me.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You see a huge spider in your room. What do you do? </div> </div> </div>\u201cAsk if Invisible Horse Princess summoned it.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you could go back and change one decision you made in the past, what would you change? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI wouldn\u2019t have left Chet by himself.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tell me about your first kiss. </div> </div> </div>\u201dNo.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you give people second chances? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI have to.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a cat person or a dog person? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI\u2019m too busy for either.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think you\u2019re attractive? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWhen I have to be.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your worst habit? </div> </div> </div>\u201cPutting off sleep.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When was the last time you cried? </div> </div> </div>\u201dWhen I failed to stop Rher\u2019s plot.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good liar? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI have to be.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your biggest pet peeve? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWhen the wealthy and powerful blind themselves to the suffering they cause.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Have you ever had your heart broken? </div> </div> </div>\u201cEvery time I look out at this city and hear the cries of the suffering.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more likely to use your fists or your words in an argument? </div> </div> </div>\u201cDepends on what the argument\u2019s about.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you\u2019re naturally good at? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI\u2019ve had a knack for understanding what motivates a person.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you had to work hard to be good at? </div> </div> </div>\u201cUnderstanding what motivates spirits.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you tell when someone is flirting with you? </div> </div> </div>\u201cMore importantly, I can tell why.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think money can buy happiness? </div> </div> </div>\u201cTo the contrary - money buys misery.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you believe in destiny? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI\u2019ve met too many gods to not believe that at least some of them have some sort of plan. The problem comes in when people believe that plan is coherent.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good cook? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI understand the basics; luckily for my guests, Avery is much more skilled in the kitchen.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you think happens after you die? </div> </div> </div>\u201cThe world is lessened.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Did you have to grow up fast? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWho doesn\u2019t, in Nexus?\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Who do you look up to? </div> </div> </div>\u201cRobin Vaara - her zeal and her intellect are both to be admired; Taroketu Kithri - her professionalism and bravery are to be commended; Lyse of the Hammer and Loom - her ruggedness and resourcefulness are inspiring; Invisible Horse Princess - her martial skill is to be feared.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When you go to a tavern, what do you order? </div> </div> </div>\u201cDepends on who I need to be.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like most about yourself? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI see people who need help, and I help them.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like least about yourself? </div> </div> </div>\u201cThere are still so many I can\u2019t help yet.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want kids someday? </div> </div> </div>\u201cThere\u2019s just too much for me to do, for that sort of thing.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a planner, or more spontaneous? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI make plans, but I know that adaptation is necessary to survive.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you keep a secret? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI have to.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you like being the center of attention? </div> </div> </div>\u201cOnly when I\u2019m trying to be.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you knew you were going to die tomorrow, what would you do today? </div> </div> </div>\u201cEverything I could.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you enjoy getting all dressed up for a special occasion? </div> </div> </div>\u201cYou\u2019d better believe it.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where do you feel safe? </div> </div> </div>\u201cIn the company of my friends.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you love or hate being alone? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI do my best work with others.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the last nightmare you remember having? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWhen I was twelve I dreamed I had forgotten my parents\u2019 faces. It frightened me so much that I had Avery buy me a dreamstone before I slept again.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you admit to mistakes when you make them? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWhen it makes sense to do so.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want to grow up to be like your parents? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI don\u2019t have that luxury.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How do you deal with being sick? Are you stoic, or super whiny? </div> </div> </div>\u201cIf Avery makes his special pepper soup I can brave anything.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What did your parents expect from you when you were born? </div> </div> </div>\u201cSomeone to carry on their legacy.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you have a strong sense of style? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI feel my wardrobe is fairly distinct.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Would you rather camp outdoors or stay the night in an inn? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI prefer the familiarity of an inn, but if there\u2019s company I\u2019m happy to camp as well.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there a food that most people like that you absolutely hate? </div> </div> </div>\u201cSoft cheeses. Why go through the trouble of turning milk into cheese if you\u2019re going to stop halfway?\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more of a hoarder or a minimalist? </div> </div> </div>\u201cSomewhere in the middle, I think. I won\u2019t turn down a useful tool, but there\u2019s no sense holding onto it once it is no longer such.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you superstitious? </div> </div> </div>\u201cRituals often have their roots in something that\u2019s still useful today; that said, if the idea is worth holding, it should stand up to a little scrutiny.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you the kind of person who remembers people\u2019s birthdays and pets\u2019 names and stuff? </div> </div> </div>\u201cYes.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you do to feel better when you\u2019re sad? </div> </div> </div>\u201cGo out and help someone.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is it hard for you to trust someone? </div> </div> </div>\u201cIt\u2019s easy to trust them to do what\u2019s in their nature.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you susceptible to peer pressure? </div> </div> </div>\u201cNot with most people.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you decided to stop adventuring and settle down, what kind of job would you take? </div> </div> </div>\u201cI\u2019m not an adventurer.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As a kid, what did you want to be when you grew up? </div> </div> </div>\u201cWhat I am now.\u201d</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200bI think this questionnaire runs a little longer than I'd prefer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 08-18-2020, 02:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T09:21:39-07:00","id":1408502,"title":"","content":"Invisible Horse Princess, Night Caste<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a morning person or more of a night owl? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I like staying out late and waking up early, so... both, I guess?&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the first thing you notice about a person when you meet them? </div> </div> </div>&quot;The way they walk and carry themselves.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You see a huge spider in your room. What do you do? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Adopt it and name it Mr. Fuzzyfangs.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you could go back and change one decision you made in the past, what would you change? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Not a damn thing.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tell me about your first kiss. </div> </div> </div>&quot;You first.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you give people second chances? </div> </div> </div>&quot;When it amuses me or my circle needs me to, sure.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a cat person or a dog person? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I'm an animal person.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think you\u2019re attractive? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Yeah, I'd do me.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your worst habit? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I have a tendency to make people explode into showers of gore when I hit them, which makes interrogations kinda difficult.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When was the last time you cried? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Lately I've been crying tears of blood non-stop. Having your eyes gouged out by the next best thing to a Deathlord will do that to you.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good liar? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Only when I'm lying to myself.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your biggest pet peeve? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Does the Knight Raiton count?&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Have you ever had your heart broken? </div> </div> </div>&quot;No, just my mind.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more likely to use your fists or your words in an argument? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Hahaha- wait, that wasn't rhetorical?&quot;<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you\u2019re naturally good at? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Murder.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you had to work hard to be good at? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Also murder. Just because you're good doesn't mean you can't be better.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you tell when someone is flirting with you? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I like to think so.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think money can buy happiness? </div> </div> </div>&quot;No, but it can buy alcohol, which makes me happy... or at least drunk.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you believe in destiny? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Of course! How could I bend it over the table if I didn't believe in it?&quot;<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good cook? </div> </div> </div>&quot;No, but I'm not a bad bartender.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you think happens after you die? </div> </div> </div>&quot;The dead man's switch activates.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Did you have to grow up fast? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Yep, having your parents murdered will do that to you.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Who do you look up to? </div> </div> </div>&quot;My brother. Robin. Lyse, when she's a twenty-foot tall lizard, but most people look up to her then, not just me.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When you go to a tavern, what do you order? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Bourbon with three candied cherries at the bottom of the glass.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like most about yourself? </div> </div> </div>&quot;My charming personality.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like least about yourself? </div> </div> </div>&quot;All the deeply-rooted self-loathing and hatred.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want kids someday? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I... don't think I'd make a very good mother. A fun aunt, maybe, but a shitty mom...&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a planner, or more spontaneous? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Dude, we should go on a road trip! Like, right now!&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you keep a secret? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Why? Something you want to get off your chest?&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you like being the center of attention? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Whether I like it or not, I usually am... and also yes.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you knew you were going to die tomorrow, what would you do today? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Kill whatever's about to do me in.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you enjoy getting all dressed up for a special occasion? </div> </div> </div>&quot;This is the last <s>suit</s> dress I'll ever wear.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where do you feel safe? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't. Everyone and everything is out to get me.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you love or hate being alone? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I prefer companionship, but enjoy a little solitude every now and then.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the last nightmare you remember having? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't have nightmares anymore. I scared them away.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you admit to mistakes when you make them? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't make mistakees.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want to grow up to be like your parents? </div> </div> </div>&quot;You mean murdered? Nah, I'll pass.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How do you deal with being sick? Are you stoic, or super whiny? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I just punch the Disease God responsible until I feel better.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What did your parents expect from you when you were born? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Probably not this.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you have a strong sense of style? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I'm proficient in Ebon Shadow, Crystal Chameleon, and Hidden Horse.&quot;<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Would you rather camp outdoors or stay the night in an inn? </div> </div> </div>&quot;They both have their own unique charm. Outdoors if I'm by myself, an inn if I have company.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there a food that most people like that you absolutely hate? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Beets. Can't stand 'em.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more of a hoarder or a minimalist? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Is kleptomaniac an option?&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you superstitious? </div> </div> </div>&quot;With gods, ghosts, and demons running around I'd be stupid not to be.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you the kind of person who remembers people\u2019s birthdays and pets\u2019 names and stuff? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Only when they're plot-relevant.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you do to feel better when you\u2019re sad? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Kill something and get drunk. Not necessarily in that order.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is it hard for you to trust someone? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't trust you enough to answer that.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you susceptible to peer pressure? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Sure, but I can count my peers on one hand, so it's not usually an issue.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you decided to stop adventuring and settle down, what kind of job would you take? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Empress of the Realm. It'd make everyone so mad, I wouldn't have to worry about going out to find adventures: they'd come to me.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As a kid, what did you want to be when you grew up? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't remember, but probably not what I am now.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24828,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24828-sasha","user":"Sasha","date":". 08-16-2020, 03:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24828-sasha","name":"Sasha","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T11:38:34-07:00","id":1408522,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Sasha that format makes it almost impossible for people to reply to you. </span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-16T12:22:35-07:00","id":1408528,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ztCCWv.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Assyrianna<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a morning person or more of a night owl? </div> </div> </div>Night Owl.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the first thing you notice about a person when you meet them? </div> </div> </div>Their clothing, then their bust size if they're a woman<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You see a huge spider in your room. What do you do? </div> </div> </div>Spiders are part of the natural ecosystem, and thus are nothing to be alarmed about.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you could go back and change one decision you made in the past, what would you change? </div> </div> </div>There are too many to count, but being more open to those I care about is a constant<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tell me about your first kiss. </div> </div> </div>a sailor on a fishing boat in my youth, using rope as a make-shift bed, the smell of salt water and an ocean breeze.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you give people second chances? </div> </div> </div>Yes, and the more I like you the more you get.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a cat person or a dog person? </div> </div> </div>Dogs.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think you\u2019re attractive? </div> </div> </div>No, but I'd never admit it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your worst habit? </div> </div> </div>I enjoy bullying people, particularly those who are not as smart as me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When was the last time you cried? </div> </div> </div>Recently.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good liar? </div> </div> </div>Only to people who don't know me, to those that do I am very transparent.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your biggest pet peeve? </div> </div> </div>People not thinking things through appropriately<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Have you ever had your heart broken? </div> </div> </div>Yes<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more likely to use your fists or your words in an argument? </div> </div> </div>Words<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you\u2019re naturally good at? </div> </div> </div>Most intellectual pursuits, particularly sorcery<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you had to work hard to be good at? </div> </div> </div>Being a good people person<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you tell when someone is flirting with you? </div> </div> </div>I assume everyone is always flirting with me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think money can buy happiness? </div> </div> </div>Or the closest approximation to it.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you believe in destiny? </div> </div> </div>Yes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good cook? </div> </div> </div>No, I can only cook particular culture recipies that those outside of my culture find distasteful.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you think happens after you die? </div> </div> </div>I know what happens after you die<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Did you have to grow up fast? </div> </div> </div>I Exalted young so I had to become an adult quickly after.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Who do you look up to? </div> </div> </div>No matter how much I grow I always think that I must become more to live up to my father.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When you go to a tavern, what do you order? </div> </div> </div>I am not fond of not sleeping under my own roof so I would probably eat whatever someone else got. I would not drink, because I have a pathetically weak tolerance<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like most about yourself? </div> </div> </div>My brain<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like least about yourself? </div> </div> </div>My Body<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want kids someday? </div> </div> </div>I have no opinions on them but if those I care about wanted them then I would have them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a planner, or more spontaneous? </div> </div> </div>I plan everything out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you keep a secret? </div> </div> </div>Not particularly well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you like being the center of attention? </div> </div> </div>I better be the center of attention.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you knew you were going to die tomorrow, what would you do today? </div> </div> </div>Spend the day desparetely trying to forestall my inevitable demise before finally realizing it was impossible and spending the remainder of my time with my loved ones and making plans to be followed for the continued governance of the country.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you enjoy getting all dressed up for a special occasion? </div> </div> </div>Yes, dressing up and looking pretty is fun.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where do you feel safe? </div> </div> </div>In my room or with my protectors.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you love or hate being alone? </div> </div> </div>I can be alone at times, but if I am alone with my thoughts for too long I inevitably start to break down and go a bit insane<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the last nightmare you remember having? </div> </div> </div>My loved ones abandoning me for my innumerable flaws.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you admit to mistakes when you make them? </div> </div> </div>No.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want to grow up to be like your parents? </div> </div> </div>Yes<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How do you deal with being sick? Are you stoic, or super whiny? </div> </div> </div>Completely whiny.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What did your parents expect from you when you were born? </div> </div> </div>To be them but better. Perhaps I've already managed that, but to me that doesn't mean I should stop<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you have a strong sense of style? </div> </div> </div>Yes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Would you rather camp outdoors or stay the night in an inn? </div> </div> </div>Camping disturbs me. Nature is important but that does not mean I want to have bugs crawling on me while I sleep.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there a food that most people like that you absolutely hate? </div> </div> </div>Broccoli and Spinach<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more of a hoarder or a minimalist? </div> </div> </div>It's not hoarding if these things might have use later!<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you superstitious? </div> </div> </div>Not as a general rule.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you the kind of person who remembers people\u2019s birthdays and pets\u2019 names and stuff? </div> </div> </div>Yes, I do not forget anything.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you do to feel better when you\u2019re sad? </div> </div> </div>I used to need to bully someone to feel better about myself, but as time has gone on being pampered by a pretty woman or man has become a way to make me feel better as well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is it hard for you to trust someone? </div> </div> </div>Not as a general rule, but I often see people as so far below me that my trust is closer to considering them insignificant then relying on them for something.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you susceptible to peer pressure? </div> </div> </div>From the right people.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you decided to stop adventuring and settle down, what kind of job would you take? </div> </div> </div>Ruler of a Country or CEO of a massive business<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As a kid, what did you want to be when you grew up? </div> </div> </div>A Queen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">https://swordofcreation.net/</a> : A secondary forum focusing on archiving homebrew, both mechanical and fluff, and receiving critique on it.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/108-flare","name":"Flare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar108_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T07:46:30-07:00","id":1408714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1408074-50-character-builder-questions-for-your-exalted-character?p=1408522#post1408522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Sasha that format makes it almost impossible for people to reply to you. </span></div> </div> </div> </div>It's kind of my bad, I was the first person who went for multiquotes to answer the questions and overlooked that combining them with bulletpoints were this forum's Kryptonite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-17T07:53:33-07:00","id":1408717,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">In the future, could you guys just use numbers? Thanks. </span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-18T11:05:10-07:00","id":1408975,"title":"","content":"<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 1. Are you a morning person or more of a night owl?<br /> 2. What\u2019s the first thing you notice about a person when you meet them?<br /> 3. You see a huge spider in your room. What do you do?<br /> 4. If you could go back and change one decision you made in the past, what would you change?<br /> 5. Tell me about your first kiss.<br /> 6. Do you give people second chances?<br /> 7. Are you a cat person or a dog person?<br /> 8. Do you think you\u2019re attractive?<br /> 9. What\u2019s your worst habit?<br /> 10. When was the last time you cried?<br /> 11. Are you a good liar?<br /> 12. What\u2019s your biggest pet peeve?<br /> 13. Have you ever had your heart broken?<br /> 14. Are you more likely to use your fists or your words in an argument?<br /> 15. What\u2019s something you\u2019re naturally good at?<br /> 16. What\u2019s something you had to work hard to be good at?<br /> 17. Can you tell when someone is flirting with you?<br /> 18. Do you think money can buy happiness?<br /> 19. Do you believe in destiny?<br /> 20. Are you a good cook?<br /> 21. What do you think happens after you die?<br /> 22. Did you have to grow up fast?<br /> 23. Who do you look up to?<br /> 24. When you go to a tavern, what do you order?<br /> 25. What do you like most about yourself?<br /> 26. What do you like least about yourself?<br /> 27. Do you want kids someday?<br /> 28. Are you a planner, or more spontaneous?<br /> 29. Can you keep a secret?<br /> 30. Do you like being the center of attention?<br /> 31. If you knew you were going to die tomorrow, what would you do today?<br /> 32. Do you enjoy getting all dressed up for a special occasion?<br /> 33. Where do you feel safe?<br /> 34. Do you love or hate being alone?<br /> 35. What\u2019s the last nightmare you remember having?<br /> 36. Do you admit to mistakes when you make them?<br /> 37. Do you want to grow up to be like your parents?<br /> 38. How do you deal with being sick? Are you stoic, or super whiny?<br /> 39. What did your parents expect from you when you were born?<br /> 40. Do you have a strong sense of style?<br /> 41. Would you rather camp outdoors or stay the night in an inn?<br /> 42. Is there a food that most people like that you absolutely hate?<br /> 43. Are you more of a hoarder or a minimalist?<br /> 44. Are you superstitious?<br /> 45. Are you the kind of person who remembers people\u2019s birthdays and pets\u2019 names and stuff?<br /> 46. What do you do to feel better when you\u2019re sad?<br /> 47. Is it hard for you to trust someone?<br /> 48. Are you susceptible to peer pressure?<br /> 49. If you decided to stop adventuring and settle down, what kind of job would you take?<br /> 50. As a kid, what did you want to be when you grew up? </div> </div> </div></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Pic, spoiled for size.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <img src=\"https://safebooru.org//samples/1780/sample_dce2bdf81192fc4ff17a0330db17ab7e6e611553.jpg?1862468\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <b>Robin Vaara</b>, Fellow Circle member to the circle of the Knight Raiton and Invisible Horse Princess. Solar of the Eclipse Caste<br /> ---------------------------------------<br /> ANSWERS<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>1.</b> &quot;I do my best work in the night and I tend to be grumpy before I have my morning tea. So I'd say Night Owl.<br /> <br /> <b>2.</b> &quot; Their expression, I find it more useful for knowing the person then their status.<br /> <br /> <b>3.</b> &quot;I fear they may soon become a common issue for me, but I'd ask Avery or IHP to deal with them and leave the room.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>4.</b> &quot;... I don't like thinking about what ifs, but to answer your question I'd have allowed Chet to keep his bodyguard...&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>5.</b> &quot;Being a bit personal. But it was when I was still young and beginning my training for my services to Lookshy's military.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>6.</b> &quot;Yes, everyone has reasons for their actions. Often if you help them then you can find solutions that help everyone.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>7.</b> &quot; Lookshy isn't as keen on pets as other lands, So I can't say since I've never owned a pet.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>8.</b> &quot; Yes, as I've been told by many, both politely and otherwise.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>9.</b> &quot; At this point, I think it's my thoughtless answering of questions, no matter what question and to who.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>10.</b>&quot; I've recently found out that a child soul may have been destroyed by my circles mistake... It was a unpleasant discovery.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>11.</b> &quot;In theory I can be a amazing liar. But I have to put conscious thought to lie otherwise, it simply doesn't come naturally to me.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>12.</b> &quot;Spoilers... it's rare to hear about a book I haven't read myself these days, but nothing ruins my mood more then that in normal circumstances.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>13.</b> &quot;Yes... But that was when I was young and just learning about romance.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>14.</b> &quot;Words, and if I must I'll use the power of my Diaklave 'Rapport' to empower them.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>15.</b> &quot;While Stories are my greatest passion, I'd say my greatest talent even before my exaltation was learning new languages, to find those stories.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>16.</b> &quot;Despite stories, not every Lookshian is amazing at the arts of combat. But my life now demands that I'm able to defend myself against superhuman threats. Thankfully Invisible Horse Princess is a good teacher.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>17.</b> &quot; In my youths no, I always thought people were just being friendly. Nowadays I do, but as I'm married I pretend not to.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>18.</b> &quot;Money can buy comfort, but money cannot buy achievement, and long term I believe that is the root of happiness. Knowing you've done good for Creation.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>19.</b> &quot;I do, but I believe that true heroes are those who's will and power can shift even that for the better.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>20.</b> &quot; I've never learned the trade, but thankfully my husband and now Avery are more then capable.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>21.</b> &quot; ... I've heard thousands of stories on what happens after you die... Unfortunately for myself, with my delving into Necromancy, I know what fate lies for me after I pass.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>22.</b> &quot;No... in comparison to many in creation, I've lived a blessed life filled with joy, family, and love... It is my hope to give such a blessing to Nexus and all of Creation in return.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>23.</b> &quot;I've looked to many fictional heroes during my youth, but so many of my circle make those heroes seem so... small. Between the Righteous Knight Raiton, The Brave Kithri, and silently heroic Lyse. And finally I feel in my heart-of-hearts that Invisible Horse Princess could be a great hero as well. If just pushed in the right direction.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>24.</b> &quot;Something light and fruity, unless I desperately need to forget something then I go for something hard like Rum.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>25.</b> &quot; My knowledge on the world at large and all of it's wonderful stories, both big and small.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>26.</b> &quot;... My naivety had brought the death of a innocent man... I'll never forgive myself until his wish for a better world is achieved.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>27.</b> &quot;I have two children at Lookshy. Sparrow and Rose Vaara...&quot; *Sighs*<br /> <br /> <b>28.</b> &quot; A true hero should be able to do both... But I'm more of a planner myself.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>29. </b>&quot;I've kept it secret that I'm a Solar Exalted so far... so yes.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>30.</b> &quot;During plays I better have the attention!... But more seriously I prefer learning about other then telling others about myself.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>31.</b> *laughs nervously* &quot;... That's a pretty dark question... But I'd return to my home and family. If I was going to die anyway, there would be no reason not to.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>32.</b> &quot;You must understand to most Lookshians I'm already overdressed. I got away with this kind of dress back in Lookshy because I was part of the theater. While I didn't hate it certainly, It was quite a shock to see what kind of dress was expected in a party in the Nexus District.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>33.</b> &quot; In Carter's home, Princess's home, and the Manse that we share. This is Nexus, and I'm a Solar, there really isn't many other places I can be safe.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>34.</b> &quot;While love is a strong word, I do like being alone when I'm writing and creating other fantastic worlds to explore.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>35.</b> &quot;... I dreamed of that Sun-damned Soulsteel warstrider... I dreamed of when I witnessed Void Between Stars attempting to repair it with the souls of hundreds or thousands of innocent people stabbed into it by their hands. Malnourished and either begging for their lives or silent in despair...&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>36.</b> &quot; I'd like to think that I do. A hero must always try to improve themselves.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>37.</b> &quot; No, they are happy and natural actors who have a love for the stage that even now I do not match. But I know they are happy for me, that like them I got to pursue my truest passion in the world of fiction writing.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>38.</b> &quot;Once when I still lived in Lookshy, I despite having a fever went to work since since I didn't want to bother anyone with my sickness. I was quickly taken back home when I passed out at the propagandist workshop, when I woke up I was berated by both my husband and the general staff stationed there.<br /> <br /> Take it as a lesson, when sick rest and ask for what you need.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>39.</b> &quot; A good daughter who shared their passion for the arts, even in Lookshy. I'm happy to say that in my own way they got such.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>40.</b> &quot;I'd say yes, even if it is more 'subdued' then much of Nexus' extravagance I'd say it's good.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>41.</b> &quot;In a Inn, no question, although I did have to learn the basics of outdoor survival during my military training... I hated it the whole time.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>42.</b> &quot;To this day, the only answer that I have for those who will eat a chickens head and legs is the threat of starvation... Whether they tell me otherwise or not.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>43.</b> &quot;I'm a hoarder at heart.... My personal room is more books and paper then bed, floor, and walls.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>44.</b> &quot; I love participating in superstitions and the stories and beliefs they tell about people and their unique views of the world!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>45.</b> &quot;Of course, every person story is wonderful in it's own way and I want to remember all of those details!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>46.</b> &quot;I write about a happier world, that has solved my grievance with the world in private. Or if the sadness is too bad for that, I write something also sad so I and my heart have an outlet for the pain.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>47.</b> &quot;Honestly, I suspect it's too <i>easy</i> to get me to trust someone.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>48.</b> &quot; I know when to slam my foot down when I have to. But I usually spend most of my time around those friendly to me.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>49.</b> &quot; I wouldn't call myself an adventurer personally, but the nice thing about being in Nexus over Lookshy, is that I can just be what I wish to be. A Author to stories, and soon a Teacher to all.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>50. </b>&quot;... I always wanted to be a Hero.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":14713,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","user":"Chronos12","date":". 08-20-2020, 12:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","name":"Chronos12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14713_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T01:12:54-07:00","id":1409091,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"https://78.media.tumblr.com/a91acc820df41b9081efcfa42babdc98/tumblr_p9o4dfVxwj1s8hcnco1_1280.png\" target=\"_blank\">Sparrow Keens for the Rain, Night Caste</a></b><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><b>1.</b> <i>&quot;Fuck</i> mornings. I sleep when I want.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>2.</b> &quot;He got a weapon? He got a mask? Gotta stay sharp.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>3.</b> &quot;Smash it real dead with a sandal or something.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>4.</b> &quot;Way many, but not most of them.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>5.</b> &quot;Who'd remember <i>that?</i> ...Was probably for stealin' food.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>6.</b> &quot;Do I owe 'em? If I owe 'em.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>7.</b> &quot;Dogs stink and I kick 'em when I see 'em. Cats at least stay distant, little shits.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>8.</b> &quot;Bitch, I don't think <i>shit</i>. 'S a <i>fact.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>9.</b> &quot;Sometimes I forget the job. Bad for business, real bad.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>10.</b> &quot;There was this... boy cheetah. Felt like I knew him. ...Real awkward crying when you fight a kid.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>11.</b> &quot;Yeah!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>12.</b> &quot;Men who don't stay <i>down.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>13.</b> &quot;Probably. I've broken more, though, so, yeah.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>14.</b> &quot;An argument or like an 'argument?' 'Cause those are different things. <i>Feet</i> though.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>15.</b> &quot;Getting men all twisted.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>16.</b> &quot;Dodging the bottles. Now I dodge lightning, <i>so.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>17.</b> &quot;Yeah, but I don't pay attention if I don't need nothing.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>18.</b> &quot;It's all it <i>for.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>19.</b> &quot;I've seen her, noose in fucking hand. Don't trust her one heartbeat.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>20.</b> &quot;When there's vendors all around town? <i>Psssh.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>21.</b> &quot;Well, you bleed everywhere, usually, and you <i>cry</i> and you <i>beg</i> and- Oh, <i>after?</i> Uuuuuuuh... You turn into an ancestor spirit, if you've got kids, but if you don't you just rot probably.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>22.</b> &quot;Fast as fire. Grew up <i>good</i>, though. Look at me!&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>23.</b> &quot;I respect the Bwana. Stone cold killer, that man, and sharp too.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>24.</b> &quot;Something sweet and warm, on a stick usually, and then something real real strong.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>25.</b> &quot;I've lived hard and I've lived hot and now this town is <i>ours.</i> We've torn it right out of the hands of those rich idiots who haven't even lived a day.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>26.</b> &quot;I... I don't feel... full, sometimes. Like I'm doing nothing, like... there should be more, but there ain't.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>27.</b> &quot;Ain't enough maiden tea in the world for me.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>28.</b> &quot;I go with my gut. Knows better than I do.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>29.</b> &quot;Most of them. Usually.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>30.</b> &quot;It's not about wantin', it's about bein', and <i>I am.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>31.</b> &quot;Crack every skull that needs crackin', and go to sleep dead drunk.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>32.</b> &quot;Yeah, <i>fuck</i> yes! You can always go more flashier.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>33.</b> &quot;Where the Bwana reigns. Where <i>we reign.</i> Whole damn town's ours, and more.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>34.</b> &quot;Don't love it, don''t hate it. It's nice sometimes.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>35.</b> &quot;...Fire.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>36.</b> &quot;When they're really mine, sure, at the right moment.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>37.</b> &quot;They grew up dead. I didn't.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>38.</b> &quot;Stay out of my fucking way when I'm down and out, nobody wants to see that.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>39.</b> &quot;Some little human bird, probably, sittin' pretty and doing numbers.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>40.</b> &quot;The strongest. Half killer, half bitch, all me.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>41.</b> &quot;Indoors, <i>shit</i>, gimme the inn.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>42.</b> &quot;I dunno, blood-milk? Nah, that's good with a chaser, maybe... Most of what I've tried, I've liked, and what I don't like people shouldn't be eatin'.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>43.</b> &quot;I mostly have clothes and wall paintings. So, uh, minimalist? Unless these minimalist people <i>clean.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>44.</b> &quot;If the Bwana pulls a rite, I follow. Usually works for me.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>45.</b> &quot;If they're leverage. Are they leverage? ...No.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>46.</b> &quot;Drink, hard and loud, 'til the feelings drown.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>47.</b> &quot;Does he have the right mask? Is he all twisted up? Is he saying he'll stab me right if I try something?&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>48.</b> &quot;The fuck's that? <i>I</i> pressure people, tight as life.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>49.</b> &quot;Same job, less blood on my dress. More hatchetmen.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>50. </b> &quot;Some kinda... numbers woman, like my parents wanted. Or alive.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-19T21:31:04-07:00","id":1409281,"title":"","content":"One for Akara the Sword Muse, Dawn Caste, Co-Regent of Whitestone Bay and founder of the Storm Riders.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a morning person or more of a night owl? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't wake before sunrise if I don't have to.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the first thing you notice about a person when you meet them? </div> </div> </div>&quot;How quickly they notice me.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> You see a huge spider in your room. What do you do? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Just smack it if it gets too close.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you could go back and change one decision you made in the past, what would you change? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Maybe I wouldn't fall for...nevermind. I'd kill the Blue Lady earlier.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tell me about your first kiss. </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't remember it.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you give people second chances? </div> </div> </div>&quot;They usually take it.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a cat person or a dog person? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Appius' wyvern is fond of me. Most animals keep their distance.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think you\u2019re attractive? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I take offense you even thought to ask.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your worst habit? </div> </div> </div>&quot;<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When was the last time you cried? </div> </div> </div>&quot;When I visited Fifth Rivers' Bounty, a patron goddess of a good friend of mine, and found her mutilated. Her beautiful voice and eyes taken away by a lunar whose name I made sure to forget along with its corpse.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good liar? </div> </div> </div>&quot;&lt;giggles&gt; I wish I was.&quot;<br /> (she is)<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s your biggest pet peeve? </div> </div> </div>&quot;People that refuse my art have no soul&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Have you ever had your heart broken? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Of course. I couldn't compose half my songs without having felt every emotion there is.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more likely to use your fists or your words in an argument? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Usually for spectacle it's both at the same time.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you\u2019re naturally good at? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Rising a ruckus. For good or ill.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s something you had to work hard to be good at? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Keeping my blade in check.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you tell when someone is flirting with you? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I had a lot of practice&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you think money can buy happiness? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Dinner before morals. Morals before verve.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you believe in destiny? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Yes.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a good cook? </div> </div> </div>&quot;No.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you think happens after you die? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Never gave it any serious thought.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Did you have to grow up fast? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Kinda.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Who do you look up to? </div> </div> </div>&quot;No one that didn't prove to be unworthy of such admiration.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When you go to a tavern, what do you order? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Anything refreshing.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like most about yourself? </div> </div> </div>&quot;My energy. I have yet to find it lacking even in the worst of times.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you like least about yourself? </div> </div> </div>&quot;&lt;shrug&gt;&quot;<br /> her temper when she's ignored.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want kids someday? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't think I <i>can</i> have them, but I didn't think much on it. It might be an interesting experience.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you a planner, or more spontaneous? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Spontaneous. The Golden Wanderer gave up on making plans involving me long ago.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you keep a secret? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Of course&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you like being the center of attention? </div> </div> </div>&quot;It is my greatest birthright.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you knew you were going to die tomorrow, what would you do today? </div> </div> </div>&quot;What I always do every day I can, but harder.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you enjoy getting all dressed up for a special occasion? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Sometimes. It's part of the show.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where do you feel safe? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Anywhere.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you love or hate being alone? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't like it.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What\u2019s the last nightmare you remember having? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Fighting the Impaled Brother was rather disturbing. I had nightmares about his curse for a couple weeks. &quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you admit to mistakes when you make them? </div> </div> </div>&quot;If needed. Usually no one even notices.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you want to grow up to be like your parents? </div> </div> </div>&quot;No idea who they are.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> How do you deal with being sick? Are you stoic, or super whiny? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I don't remember ever getting sick my whole life.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What did your parents expect from you when you were born? </div> </div> </div>&quot;No idea. Probably that I disappeared.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do you have a strong sense of style? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I <b>am</b> style.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Would you rather camp outdoors or stay the night in an inn? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Wherever there are more people.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there a food that most people like that you absolutely hate? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Shrimps of any sort.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you more of a hoarder or a minimalist? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Minimalist. The tools of my trade are all I need. Anything else I can get as needed.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you superstitious? </div> </div> </div>&quot;No.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you the kind of person who remembers people\u2019s birthdays and pets\u2019 names and stuff? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I am.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What do you do to feel better when you\u2019re sad? </div> </div> </div>&quot;If I can't tire myself out of it I usually sing it out.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is it hard for you to trust someone? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Nah. Untrustworthy people are really obvious to spot.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are you susceptible to peer pressure? </div> </div> </div>&quot;Peer pressure is susceptible to me.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you decided to stop adventuring and settle down, what kind of job would you take? </div> </div> </div>&quot;I could go back to being a simpmle entertainer. I'll probably die long before I have thoughts of settling though.&quot;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As a kid, what did you want to be when you grew up? </div